    {
      "x": -2025,
      "y": -2305,
      "id": "I1283:52;48:18325",
      "name": "This Figma UI Kit for iOS 17 is provided \"as is,\" without any guarantees of perfect alignment with the actual iOS 17 user interface. This Kit is intended to be an approximation of the interface design, not an exact replication. It is designed to aid you in creating and conceptualizing your designs by offering a broad interpretation of the interface elements found in iOS 17.",
